          "Both methods have identical auth/token type-dispatch logic (OAuthAccessToken \u2192 oauth_application, TeamAPIToken \u2192 api_token, Device \u2192 device) and the same sensitive-key sanitization",
          "The deferred import of `eventyay.api.models` inside both implementations is a symptom: the base model layer needs OAuth types to classify log entries, but can't import api at module scope due to the cycle this creates"
