          "LogMixin.log_action() sanitizes sensitive keys, creates LogEntry with conditional webhook/notification dispatch, and handles auth/token mapping across 5 different auth types \u2014 all untested against eventyay code.",
          "FileCleanupMixin.save() schedules a task_cleanup_file async task with a 10-second countdown when a FileField changes \u2014 race-condition-sensitive behavior with no test.",
          "GenerateCode.assign_code() uses a retry loop against a unique constraint and OrderedModel.move() does in-memory list manipulation followed by positional saves \u2014 both untested."
