      "detector": "review",
      "file": ".",
      "tier": 1,
      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "FileCleanupMixin.save() silently catches all exceptions from the pre-save database lookup with no logging or propagation",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "error_consistency",
        "related_files": [
          "app/eventyay/base/models/mixins.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "Lines 153-156: `try: pre_save_instance = self.__class__.objects.get(pk=self.pk) except Exception: return super().save(*args, **kwargs)`",
          "If the DB lookup fails for any reason (connection error, IntegrityError, OperationalError), the mixin silently proceeds as if there is no existing record, potentially leaving orphaned files without logging the failure"
