      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "initialization_coupling",
        "related_files": [
          "app/eventyay/base/signals.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "Line 14: `app_cache = {}` mutable module-level dict.",
          "Lines 17-21: `_populate_app_cache()` assigns to the global `app_cache` without any lock.",
          "Lines 35-36: `resolve_app_for_module()` checks `if not app_cache:` and calls `_populate_app_cache()` \u2014 this check-then-set is not atomic under concurrent access."
